[00:27.64]Аnyway the path is wrong
{"无论这条路多么错误"}
[00:33.52]But no matter, we break walls
{"但没关系　我们破墙前行"}
[00:39.62]We will swim along the floor
{"我们将贴着地面游弋"}
[00:45.62]And its lay in my skype calls (But now i see)
{"它潜伏在我的网络通话里（但现在我明白了）"}
[01:39.57]Now I'm twelve and i start smoke
{"如今我十二岁开始抽烟"}
[01:45.64]People say that it is wrong
{"人们说这是不对的"}
[01:51.62]Now I'm snatching my eyeballs
{"现在我抠出自己的眼球"}
[01:57.62]Cause again now my skype calls (But now i see)
